      "definition": "Activities and services that help people or organisations structure, contribute to, administer or access giving and funding pathways.",
      "inclusion_boundary": "Includes donor-advised funds, named funds, collective or workplace giving, grantmaking administration, fundraising infrastructure and related professional support.",
      "exclusion_boundary": "Excludes the charitable purpose pursued by funded projects, fundraising receipts themselves, and verified outcomes of funded work.",
